---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import MedicalDisclaimer from '../components/MedicalDisclaimer.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import authorPhoto from '../assets/denis-ethier.png';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead 
			title="Weekly Group Call: BMS Discussion | Decoding The Burn" 
			description="Join our weekly positive, solution-oriented live group call for Burning Mouth Syndrome sufferers to compare notes, identify triggers, and find relief together." 
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="hero-centered-wrapper">
				<div class="hero-centered-header">
					<MedicalDisclaimer />
					<h1 class="hero-centered-title">
						Weekly Group&nbsp;Call
					</h1>
					<p class="hero-centered-subtitle">
						A weekly live, positive problem-solving circle for sufferers to compare notes, identify hidden triggers, and find relief&nbsp;together.
					</p>
				</div>

				<!-- Host Photo / Community Banner -->
				<div class="hero-video-centered">
					<div class="video-placeholder-wrapper" style="cursor: default;">
						<Image 
							src={authorPhoto} 
							alt="Denis Ethier - Host of Weekly Discussion Group Call" 
							class="video-placeholder-img" 
							width={1400} 
							height={788}
						/>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Main Description & Invitation -->
				<article class="personal-story-section">
					<div class="story-lead">
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							If you are living with Burning Mouth Syndrome, you know how isolating the daily rollercoaster can be. The physical burning is agonizing, but the mental exhaustion of trying to figure out why a flare happened—and having no one who truly understands to bounce ideas off of—is just as challenging.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							That is why we host a <strong>Weekly Discussion Group Call</strong>. This is an open, constructive, and forward-looking live video gathering where we compare notes, share what is making our symptoms better or worse, discuss newly identified dietary or dental triggers, and learn from each other's lived observations.
						</p>
						<p class="story-paragraph">
							If you would like to participate or drop in to listen, please <a href="#join-circle" class="inline-story-link">join our notification list below</a> so you can receive updates and access links for our upcoming calls.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Friendly Community Guidelines Box -->
					<div class="guidelines-card">
						<div class="guidelines-header">
							<div class="guidelines-icon" aria-hidden="true">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
								</svg>
							</div>
							<h2 class="guidelines-title">Our Circle Guidelines</h2>
						</div>

						<ul class="guidelines-list">
							<li>
								<strong>Yes, We Can Talk About the Pain:</strong> There is zero judgment here. We understand the desperation, the tears, and the emotional toll this fire takes on your daily life. Acknowledging the reality of what we feel is the first step.
							</li>
							<li>
								<strong>Our Core Focus is Solutions &amp; Triggers:</strong> While we validate the struggle, our collective energy is dedicated to constructive discovery: <em>What did you eat 48 hours before the flare? Did dental scaling help or hurt? Have you noticed pH sensitivities?</em>
							</li>
							<li>
								<strong>Kindness &amp; Mutual Respect:</strong> Every person's biology is unique. What brings relief to one person might not work for another. We share personal data points and observations with humility and open minds.
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<!-- How Attendance & Notifications Work (3 Columns with Icons and Flow) -->
					<div class="schedule-explainer">
						<h3 class="schedule-title">How It Works</h3>
						<p class="schedule-text">
							To ensure every session has a vibrant, meaningful group discussion, we confirm attendance 24 hours prior. Here is the 3-step process:
						</p>
						
						<div class="schedule-steps-grid">
							<!-- Step 1: Email -->
							<div class="step-card">
								<div class="step-card-header">
									<div class="step-icon-wrapper icon-mail">
										<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
											<path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
											<polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
										</svg>
									</div>
									<span class="step-number-pill">Step 1</span>
								</div>
								<h4 class="step-card-title">Email</h4>
								<p class="step-card-desc">
									Enter your email in the <a href="#join-circle" class="step-link">notification list</a> below.
								</p>
								<div class="step-card-footer-arrow">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#be123c" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
										<line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
										<polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
									</svg>
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Connector Arrow 1 -->
							<div class="step-arrow-connector" aria-hidden="true">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="36" height="36" fill="none" stroke="#be123c" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12"></line>
									<polyline points="13 5 20 12 13 19"></polyline>
								</svg>
							</div>

							<!-- Step 2: Check Email -->
							<div class="step-card">
								<div class="step-card-header">
									<div class="step-icon-wrapper icon-bell">
										<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
											<path d="M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"></path>
											<path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"></path>
										</svg>
									</div>
									<span class="step-number-pill">Step 2</span>
								</div>
								<h4 class="step-card-title">Check Email</h4>
								<p class="step-card-desc">
									Receive confirmation email sent the day before the session.
								</p>
								<div class="step-card-footer-arrow">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#be123c" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
										<line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
										<polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
									</svg>
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Connector Arrow 2 -->
							<div class="step-arrow-connector" aria-hidden="true">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="36" height="36" fill="none" stroke="#be123c" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12"></line>
									<polyline points="13 5 20 12 13 19"></polyline>
								</svg>
							</div>

							<!-- Step 3: Join Live -->
							<div class="step-card">
								<div class="step-card-header">
									<div class="step-icon-wrapper icon-video">
										<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
											<polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"></polygon>
											<rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
										</svg>
									</div>
									<span class="step-number-pill">Step 3</span>
								</div>
								<h4 class="step-card-title">Join Live</h4>
								<p class="step-card-desc">
									Click the private link to participate or listen at your own pace.
								</p>
								<div class="step-card-footer-arrow">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#be123c" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
										<path d="M12 5v14M19 12l-7 7-7-7"></path>
									</svg>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Direct pointing arrow to registration box -->
						<div class="scroll-down-arrow-wrapper">
							<a href="#join-circle" class="arrow-scroll-link" aria-label="Scroll to signup form">
								<span class="arrow-prompt-text">Join the notification list below</span>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="36" height="36" fill="none" stroke="#be123c" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="bounce-arrow">
									<line x1="12" y1="4" x2="12" y2="20"></line>
									<polyline points="19 13 12 20 5 13"></polyline>
								</svg>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Registration Box -->
					<div class="collab-cta-box" id="join-circle">
						<h3 class="collab-cta-title">Join the Notification List</h3>
						<p class="collab-cta-text">
							Enter your email below so I can notify you 24 hours before our next Weekly Discussion Group Call.
						</p>
						
						<!-- MailerLite Form Embed / Direct Submit -->
						<form class="circle-signup-form" action="https://assets.mailerlite.com/jsonp/2046918/forms/0R4iAA/subscribe" method="post">
							<div class="input-row">
								<input 
									type="email" 
									name="fields[email]" 
									placeholder="Enter your email address..." 
									required 
									aria-label="Email address"
									class="circle-email-input"
								/>
								<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary circle-submit-btn">Notify Me</button>
							</div>
						</form>
						<p class="circle-privacy-note">Zero spam. You will only receive notifications about upcoming group calls.</p>
					</div>
				</article>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.hero-centered-wrapper {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
	}

	.hero-centered-header {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 780px;
		margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
	}

	.hero-centered-title {
		font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0.75rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.hero-centered-subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin: 0;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.hero-video-centered {
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto 3rem;
		border-radius: 20px;
		overflow: hidden;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08));
		background: #000000;
	}

	.video-placeholder-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.video-placeholder-img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}

	.personal-story-section {
		background: var(--bg-card, #ffffff);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e2e8f0);
		border-radius: 24px;
		padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
	}

	.story-lead {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
	}

	.story-paragraph {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	/* Guidelines Card */
	.guidelines-card {
		background: #f8fafc;
		border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
		margin: 2.5rem 0;
	}

	.guidelines-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
		padding-bottom: 0.85rem;
	}

	.guidelines-icon {
		color: #991b1b;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.guidelines-title {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.guidelines-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.guidelines-list li {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		position: relative;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	.guidelines-list li::before {
		content: "•";
		color: #991b1b;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: -2px;
	}

	.guidelines-list strong {
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.inline-story-link {
		color: #be123c;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
		transition: color 0.15s ease;
	}

	.inline-story-link:hover {
		color: #9f1239;
	}

	/* Schedule Explainer & 3-Column Steps Grid */
	.schedule-explainer {
		margin: 3.5rem 0 2rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.schedule-title {
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		line-height: 1.2;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.schedule-text {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.schedule-steps-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.85rem;
		text-align: left;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.step-card {
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
		border-radius: 18px;
		padding: 1.65rem 1.4rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 14px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
		min-height: 220px;
	}

	.step-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		border-color: #cbd5e1;
	}

	.step-card-header {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.step-icon-wrapper {
		width: 46px;
		height: 46px;
		border-radius: 12px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.icon-mail {
		background: #fee2e2;
		color: #991b1b;
	}

	.icon-bell {
		background: #fef3c7;
		color: #b45309;
	}

	.icon-video {
		background: #dbeafe;
		color: #1d4ed8;
	}

	.step-number-pill {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		color: #64748b;
		background: #f1f5f9;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
	}

	.step-card-title {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		margin: 0;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.step-card-desc {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		margin: 0;
		flex: 1;
	}

	.step-card-footer-arrow {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		padding-top: 0.5rem;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}

	.step-link {
		color: #991b1b;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 2px;
	}

	.step-arrow-connector {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}

	/* Scroll Down Arrow Wrapper */
	.scroll-down-arrow-wrapper {
		margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.arrow-scroll-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.4rem;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: #991b1b;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease;
	}

	.arrow-scroll-link:hover {
		transform: translateY(2px);
	}

	.bounce-arrow {
		animation: bounceDown 1.8s infinite;
	}

	@keyframes bounceDown {
		0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% {
			transform: translateY(0);
		}
		40% {
			transform: translateY(6px);
		}
		60% {
			transform: translateY(3px);
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.schedule-steps-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.25rem;
		}

		.step-arrow-connector {
			transform: rotate(90deg);
			margin: -0.25rem auto;
		}

		.step-card {
			min-height: auto;
		}
	}

	/* Sign Up Box */
	.collab-cta-box {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1136 0%, #0d081a 100%);
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 2.75rem 2.25rem;
		text-align: center;
		color: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35);
		box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
		margin: 2rem 0 0;
	}

	.collab-cta-title {
		font-size: 1.65rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #ffffff;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.collab-cta-text {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #e2e8f0;
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.circle-signup-form {
		max-width: 520px;
		margin: 0 auto 1rem;
	}

	.input-row {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.circle-email-input {
		flex: 1;
		min-width: 240px;
		padding: 0.95rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		color: #ffffff;
		font-size: 1rem;
		outline: none;
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.circle-email-input:focus {
		border-color: #c084fc;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
	}

	.circle-email-input::placeholder {
		color: #94a3b8;
	}

	.circle-submit-btn {
		padding: 0.95rem 2rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 1rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: transform 0.15s ease, filter 0.15s ease;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c8382c 0%, #991b1b 100%);
		color: #ffffff;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(200, 56, 44, 0.35);
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		filter: brightness(1.1);
	}

	.circle-privacy-note {
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: #94a3b8;
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.personal-story-section {
			padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		}

		.input-row {
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.circle-submit-btn {
			width: 100%;
		}
	}
</style>
